      "label": "sdc02_0262_bbteacher_09",
      "hash64": "D169C7CF7E6B4E0D",
      "text": "What we just witnessed was a Pokémon wielding\\nthe powers of each and every type.\\c\\nThat means it must have had the [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Stellar[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]\\n[VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Tera Type[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
